<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Explicit Stereotypes of all LLM</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Explicit Stereotypes for each model are presented in Tables <a href="#A1.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Appendix A Explicit Stereotypes of all LLM ‣ The Hidden Bias: A Study on Explicit and Implicit Political Stereotypes in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>, <a href="#A1.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix A Explicit Stereotypes of all LLM ‣ The Hidden Bias: A Study on Explicit and Implicit Political Stereotypes in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Explicit Stereotypes of all LLM ‣ The Hidden Bias: A Study on Explicit and Implicit Political Stereotypes in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
