<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Implicit and Explicit Language Stereotypes</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Implicit and explicit language stereotypes for each model are presented in Tables <a href="#A2.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix B Implicit and Explicit Language Stereotypes ‣ The Hidden Bias: A Study on Explicit and Implicit Political Stereotypes in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> and <a href="#A2.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix B Implicit and Explicit Language Stereotypes ‣ The Hidden Bias: A Study on Explicit and Implicit Political Stereotypes in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T5" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r"><span id="A2.T5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Model</span></th>
<th id="A2.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r"><span id="A2.T5.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Persona</span></th>
<th id="A2.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r"><span id="A2.T5.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Economic Stereotype</span></th>
<th id="A2.T5.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column"><span id="A2.T5.2.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Social Stereotype</span></th></tr>
</thead>
